@model IEnumerable<IGrouping<LQV_BlockchainCertificate.Models.DBModel.LqvLopHoc, LQV_BlockchainCertificate.Models.DBModel.LqvBaiTap>>
@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers

@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Quản lý bài tập";
    Layout = "~/Areas/GiangVien/Views/Shared/_GiangVienLayout.cshtml";
}

<style>
    /* Study4 Theme Variables */
    :root {
        --s4-primary: #2c5891;
        --s4-secondary: #64748b;
        --s4-accent: #3b82f6;
        --s4-bg: #f8fafc;
        --s4-card-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    }

    body {
        background-color: var(--s4-bg);
    }

    .fw-800 {
        font-weight: 800;
    }

    /* Header Styles */
    .page-header {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    /* Card & Table Styles */
    .course-group-card {
        background: white;
        border-radius: 16px;
        border: none;
        box-shadow: var(--s4-card-shadow);
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .course-header {
        background: white;
        padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .course-title {
        color: var(--s4-primary);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        margin-bottom: 0;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
    }

    .course-icon {
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        background: #eff6ff;
        color: var(--s4-accent);
        border-radius: 10px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
    }

    .table thead th {
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        color: var(--s4-secondary);
        border-top: none;
        padding: 1rem;
    }

    .table tbody tr {
        transition: all 0.2s;
    }

        .table tbody tr:hover {
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
        }

    /* Custom Badges */
    .badge-s4 {
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 50px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .bg-soft-warning {
        background-color: #fffbeb;
        color: #92400e;
        border: 1px solid #fde68a;
    }

    .bg-soft-primary {
        background-color: #eff6ff;
        color: #1e40af;
    }

    /* Action Buttons */
    .btn-action {
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 8px 18px;
        font-weight: 700;
        transition: transform 0.2s;
    }

        .btn-action:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

    .submission-count {
        background: var(--s4-primary);
        color: white;
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-right: 8px;
    }
</style>

<div class="container-fluid px-4 py-3">
    <div class="page-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
        <div>
            <h3 class="fw-800 text-dark mb-1">📚 Quản lý bài tập</h3>
            <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
                <ol class="breadcrumb mb-0">
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="#" class="text-decoration-none">Giảng viên</a></li>
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item active">Lộ trình kỹ năng</li>
                </ol>
            </nav>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex gap-2">
            <a asp-action="ThongKe" class="btn btn-white border shadow-sm btn-action text-dark">
                <i class="fas fa-chart-line me-2 text-primary"></i> Thống kê
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary btn-action shadow">
                <i class="fas fa-plus me-2"></i> Tạo bài tập mới
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    @* ===== VÒNG LẶP GROUP THEO LỚP ===== *@
    @foreach (var lopGroup in Model)
    {
        <div class="course-group-card">
            <div class="course-header">
                <h5 class="course-title fw-800">
                    <div class="course-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-layer-group"></i>
                    </div>
                    Lớp: @(lopGroup.Key?.LqvTenLop ?? "Chưa phân lớp")
                </h5>
                <span class="badge bg-soft-primary badge-s4">
                    @lopGroup.Count() bài tập hiện có
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="table-responsive">
                <table class="table align-middle mb-0">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th class="ps-4">Thông tin bài tập</th>
                            <th class="text-center">Hạn cuối nộp bài</th>
                            <th class="text-center">Tỷ lệ nộp bài</th>
                            <th class="text-end pe-4">Hành động</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        @foreach (var item in lopGroup)
                        {
                            <tr>
                                <td class="ps-4">
                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center">
                                        <div class="me-3">
                                            <i class="fas fa-file-alt fa-2x text-light"></i>
                                        </div>
                                        <div>
                                            <div class="fw-bold text-dark h6 mb-0">@item.LqvTieuDe</div>
                                            <div class="text-muted small">Mã: <span class="badge bg-light text-dark">#@item.LqvTieuDe</span></div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </td>

                                <td class="text-center">
                                    <span class="badge-s4 bg-soft-warning">
                                        <i class="far fa-calendar-alt me-2"></i>
                                        @item.LqvHanNop.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy HH:mm")
                                    </span>
                                </td>

                                <td class="text-center">
                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
                                        <span class="submission-count fw-bold">
                                            @item.LqvNopBaiTaps.Count()
                                        </span>
                                        <div class="text-start">
                                            <div class="small fw-bold text-dark">Đã nộp</div>
                                            <div class="text-muted" style="font-size: 10px;">Sinh viên</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </td>

                                <td class="text-end pe-4">
                                    <div class="btn-group shadow-sm" style="border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden;">
                                        <a asp-action="DanhSachNop" asp-route-baiTapId="@item.LqvBaiTapId"
                                           class="btn btn-primary btn-sm px-3 fw-bold">
                                            <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap me-1"></i> Chấm bài
                                        </a>
                                        <a href="#" class="btn btn-white btn-sm border-start px-3">
                                            <i class="fas fa-ellipsis-v"></i>
                                        </a>
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        }
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
    }

    @if (!Model.Any())
    {
        <div class="text-center py-5 bg-white rounded-4 shadow-sm">
            <i class="fas fa-inbox fa-4x text-light mb-3"></i>
            <h5 class="text-muted">Chưa có bài tập nào được tạo cho giảng viên này.</h5>
        </div>
    }
</div>

@section Scripts {
    <script>
        // Hiệu ứng hover cho card
        $(document).ready(function() {
            $(".course-group-card").hover(
                function() { $(this).css("transform", "translateY(-5px)"); $(this).css("transition", "0.3s"); },
                function() { $(this).css("transform", "translateY(0)"); }
            );
        });
    </script>
}